.SS snapshot
.PP
.I Take a pre\-migration hypervisor snapshot (the authoritative rollback)
.PP
.B Category:
Migration
.br
.B Maturity:
draft
.PP
.B SYNTAX
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
lamboot\-pve\-migrate snapshot VMID [\-\-name NAME] [\-\-json]
.fi
.RE
.PP
.B ARGUMENTS
.PP
.RS 4
.TP
.B VMID
Proxmox VMID
.TP
.B \-\-name NAME
Snapshot name (default: pre_uefi_migration)
.RE
.PP
.B EXAMPLES
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
sudo lamboot\-pve\-migrate snapshot 129
.fi
.RE
.PP
.B NOTES
.PP
.RS 4
Quiesces via the guest agent when available. The hypervisor snapshot is the reliable migration rollback.
.RE
.PP
.B OFFLINE:
No \- requires online system
.br
.B PRIVILEGE:
Requires root (sudo)
.PP
.B SEE ALSO
.PP
.RS 4
prep\-uefi, rollback
.RE
.PP
