.SS prep\-uefi
.PP
.I Prepare a VM for BIOS→UEFI migration (snapshot + OVMF/efidisk + method scaffolding)
.PP
.B Category:
Migration
.br
.B Maturity:
draft
.PP
.B SYNTAX
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
lamboot\-pve\-migrate prep\-uefi VMID [\-\-method B|C] [\-\-storage POOL] [\-\-esp\-size MB] [\-\-iso VOLID] [\-\-no\-snapshot] [\-\-dry\-run] [\-\-yes] [\-\-json]
.fi
.RE
.PP
.B ARGUMENTS
.PP
.RS 4
.TP
.B VMID
Proxmox VMID (must be powered off)
.TP
.B \-\-method B
\-\-method B
.TP
.B C
Migration method to scaffold for (default: B, live\-ISO chroot)
.TP
.B \-\-storage POOL
Storage for the efidisk / ESP disk (default: derive from scsi0)
.TP
.B \-\-esp\-size MB
Method C ESP disk size in MB (default: 550)
.TP
.B \-\-iso VOLID
Method B live ISO volume to attach + boot first
.TP
.B \-\-no\-snapshot
Skip the pre\-migration snapshot (not recommended)
.RE
.PP
.B EXAMPLES
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
sudo lamboot\-pve\-migrate prep\-uefi 129 \-\-method B \-\-iso local:iso/ubuntu\-25.10\-desktop\-amd64.iso
.fi
.RE
.PP
.B NOTES
.PP
.RS 4
Sets machine=q35, bios=ovmf, adds efidisk0 (efitype=4m,pre\-enrolled\-keys=0). Method B attaches the ISO + boots it first; Method C adds a separate ESP disk. Requires the VM powered off; never powers it on.
.RE
.PP
.B OFFLINE:
No \- requires online system
.br
.B PRIVILEGE:
Requires root (sudo)
.PP
.B SEE ALSO
.PP
.RS 4
snapshot, finalize\-uefi
.RE
.PP
.B DOCUMENTATION URL
.PP
.RS 4
.UR https://github.com/lamco-admin/lamboot-tools
.UE
.RE
.PP
.SS finalize\-uefi
.PP
.I Finalize a VM after conversion (detach ISO, set boot order, seed fallback if needed)
.PP
.B Category:
Migration
.br
.B Maturity:
draft
.PP
.B SYNTAX
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
lamboot\-pve\-migrate finalize\-uefi VMID [\-\-boot\-disk DEV] [\-\-seed\-fallback auto|always|never] [\-\-keep\-iso] [\-\-dry\-run] [\-\-yes] [\-\-json]
.fi
.RE
.PP
.B ARGUMENTS
.PP
.RS 4
.TP
.B VMID
Proxmox VMID (must be powered off)
.TP
.B \-\-boot\-disk DEV
Disk to boot (default: auto\-detect the converted root disk)
.TP
.B \-\-seed\-fallback MODE
Seed \\EFI\\BOOT\\BOOTX64.EFI into the efidisk NVRAM — auto (only if empty), always, never (default: auto)
.TP
.B \-\-keep\-iso
Leave the live ISO attached (default: detach)
.RE
.PP
.B EXAMPLES
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
sudo lamboot\-pve\-migrate finalize\-uefi 129
.fi
.RE
.PP
.B NOTES
.PP
.RS 4
Detaches the live ISO, sets boot order to the converted disk, and — only when the efidisk NVRAM carries no boot entry — seeds the firmware\-removable fallback via virt\-fw\-vars. Requires the VM powered off; never powers it on.
.RE
.PP
.B OFFLINE:
No \- requires online system
.br
.B PRIVILEGE:
Requires root (sudo)
.PP
.B SEE ALSO
.PP
.RS 4
prep\-uefi, lamboot\-nvram
.RE
.PP
.B DOCUMENTATION URL
.PP
.RS 4
.UR https://github.com/lamco-admin/lamboot-tools
.UE
.RE
.PP
.SS rollback
.PP
.I Roll a VM back to its pre\-migration snapshot
.PP
.B Category:
Migration
.br
.B Maturity:
draft
.PP
.B SYNTAX
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
lamboot\-pve\-migrate rollback VMID [\-\-name NAME] [\-\-yes] [\-\-json]
.fi
.RE
.PP
.B ARGUMENTS
.PP
.RS 4
.TP
.B VMID
Proxmox VMID (must be powered off)
.TP
.B \-\-name NAME
Snapshot to roll back to (default: pre_uefi_migration)
.RE
.PP
.B EXAMPLES
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
sudo lamboot\-pve\-migrate rollback 129
.fi
.RE
.PP
.B NOTES
.PP
.RS 4
Restores the entire VM (disk + efidisk NVRAM) to the pre\-migration snapshot. Requires the VM powered off; never powers it off itself.
.RE
.PP
.B OFFLINE:
No \- requires online system
.br
.B PRIVILEGE:
Requires root (sudo)
.PP
.B SEE ALSO
.PP
.RS 4
snapshot, prep\-uefi
.RE
.PP
.B DOCUMENTATION URL
.PP
.RS 4
.UR https://github.com/lamco-admin/lamboot-tools
.UE
